Except where noted otherwise (see `meta/licensing.md`):

- Vault metadata, catalog data, process documentation and link structures are dedicated to the public domain (CC0) to the extent possible under law. Fact data (standard references, titles, ICS, dates, links) is treated as non-protected facts; IEC product data is quoted with attribution to IEC sources (`meta/sources.md`).
- Electropedia-derived content: CC BY 4.0 (attribution required, see `meta/licensing.md`).
- IEC document bodies (PDFs of IS/TS/TR/PAS/RLV/…) are NOT included (copyright IEC — see `meta/licensing.md`).
- Note: see `meta/open-source-assessment.md` for the full "can we open source?" analysis (verbatim excerpts, action list).
